BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Introduction to Meditation Morning (Beginners)
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260913T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260913T130000
UID:dc59c7d150204e1dc9c358e0@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Learn fundamental tools to work with your mind\, and begin to 
 transform it. This is an opportunity to familiarise yourself with the prac
 tices we teach at the LBC\, or learn meditation from scratch. After lunch
 \, you will join in with the silent meditation day.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/urban-retreat-2026-intro
 duction-to-meditation-morning
END:VEVENT
