DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260913T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260913T160000
UID:c750f4bcba29df0e1521c827@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Dive in with a full day of collective practice. Expect plenty 
 of meditation\, and silence to help us take our practice deeper. Suitable 
 for those who have learned the Mindfulness of Breathing and Metta Bhavana 
 practices as we teach them at the LBC.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/urban-retreat-2026-total
 -immersion-day
END:VEVENT
